      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "从基础数值到多种属性自由改造技能，以个人方式挑战更强敌人",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "From simple stats to a variety of attributes, customize your skills the way you want them to work for you and take on stronger enemies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3349840/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
